  src/__tests__/topContributorsV3.substituted.test.tsx  NEW - the instrument
  docs/evidence/d2/tc-v3/run-substituted-gate.mjs       NEW - one-command runner

No SQL, no supabase/**, no docs/gates/**, no ledger. No change to the four
